        "# Business Story\n",
        "\n",
        "### Context\n",
        "\n",
        "This analysis examines supermarket sales data to understand sales performance, customer purchasing patterns, product performance, and factors that are associated with higher transaction values."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "13SiHfdNncHx"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Finding\n",
        "\n",
        "Food and Beverages generated the highest total sales, with sales of 56,144.84, while Health and Beauty generated the lowest total sales at 49,193.74. Electronic Accessories had the highest quantity sold, with 971 items.\n",
        "\n",
        "Member customers also generated higher total sales than Normal customers, with 164,223.44 compared with 158,743.31."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "UpI09nl4nmlY"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Deeper Finding\n",
        "\n",
        "Although Electronic Accessories had the highest quantity sold, Food and Beverages generated higher total sales. This shows that selling more items does not always result in the highest sales revenue.\n",
        "\n",
        "The correlation analysis also showed a positive relationship between Quantity and Total Sales, with a correlation of approximately 0.71. This means that transactions involving larger quantities generally tend to have higher total sales.\n",
        "\n",
        "Member customers had a slightly higher average transaction value of 327.79 compared with 318.12 for Normal customers. This suggests that Member customers tended to spend slightly more per transaction."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "q-MHLfKZnzkv"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Recommendation\n",
        "\n",
        "### The supermarket should continue monitoring the performance of Food and Beverages because it generated the highest total sales. Management can also investigate why Electronic Accessories had the highest quantity sold but did not generate the highest revenue.\n",
        "\n",
        "### The supermarket could also consider strategies that encourage Normal customers to become Members, while continuing to maintain engagement with existing Members who have slightly higher average transaction values.\n",
        "\n",
        "Finally, sales and quantity should be monitored together because focusing only on the number of items sold may not provide a complete picture of revenue performance."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Ip0pifROoAFA"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Cause, Effect, and Business Impact\n",
        "\n",
        "### Cause\n",
        "### The analysis shows a positive relationship between the quantity of items purchased and total sales. Transactions with larger quantities tend to have higher total sales values. However, correlation alone does not prove that quantity directly causes higher sales.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Effect\n",
        "### When customers purchase more items in a transaction, the total value of that transaction generally increases. This is supported by the correlation between Quantity and Total Sales of approximately 0.71.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Business Impact\n",
        "### The supermarket can use this insight to encourage customers to purchase more items per transaction. Strategies such as product bundles, promotions, and cross-selling related products could potentially increase transaction values and overall sales."
