      "source": [
        "## Conclusion\n",
        "\n",
        "### The analysis of the supermarket sales dataset provided useful insights into product performance, customer purchasing behavior, and sales patterns. Food and beverages generated the highest total sales, while electronic accessories recorded the highest quantity sold. Fashion accessories had the highest average unit price among the product lines.\n",
        "\n",
        "### The analysis also showed that members generated higher total sales and had a higher average transaction value than normal customers. Furthermore, the correlation analysis indicated that quantity and total sales have a strong positive relationship, suggesting that transactions involving larger quantities generally result in higher sales values.\n",
